1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:05,078
Linkage is the tendency of genes on the same chromosome to travel together.

2
00:00:05,078 --> 00:00:13,203
All the genes on one chromosome make a linkage group, so a species has as many linkage groups as its haploid chromosome number.

3
00:00:13,203 --> 00:00:14,427
Pea, seven.

4
00:00:14,427 --> 00:00:15,559
Maize, ten.

5
00:00:15,559 --> 00:00:16,927
Fruit fly, four.

6
00:00:16,927 --> 00:00:18,684
Humans, twenty three.

